  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound mochiko (glutinous rice flour)",
    "2.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 cup butter, melted",
    "3 cups whole milk",
    "5 eggs",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 cup sweetened, flaked coconut"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8PX3HG_SNxCsVmGkg-c5381H2AQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/748_Ono-Butter-Mochi_Mise-en-place_CD_55629-1-694d4a86dde64452a4ba87d1a4239de4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84857/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk eggs, vanilla, and milk together in a medium bowl. Stir rice flour, sugar, and baking powder together in a separate larger bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rvy3ntwc2eqNc2GTBoKnRyUZV9U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/748_Ono-Butter-Mochi_Step-2_CD_55630-1-c573b3daa8b247b4b84217fcee5f42ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84857/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir egg mixture into flour mixture until blend. Mix in melted butter and coconut. Pour into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k-7X-wiFfBtGwzLcKh884SQXBNc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/748_Ono-Butter-Mochi_Step-4_CD_55631-1-ee355fe538fb4050a686db191bd0e22f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/84857/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 1 hour. Cool completely in the pan on a wire rack until mochi has set. The texture will improve as it cools. Use a sharp, greased knife to cut into squares.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IZNipNsjcxF6UtTgEgUX0Wq_wB8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/748_Ono-Butter-Mochi_Step-6_CD_55633-0629c63f1341436b8a5671cb50100183.jpg"
      ],
